\title{enrichVolcano: Volcano-in-Ring and Concordance Plots from Enrichment Results}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.png}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

Draws figures from gene-set enrichment results computed elsewhere. Results from fgsea, clusterProfiler, limma's rotation and competitive gene-set tests, over-representation analysis or custom tables are converted into one validated object. From it the package draws a differential abundance volcano inside a ring of enrichment terms, and a scatter comparing two contrasts term by term. Redundant terms can be flagged for display with the EnrichmentMap overlap rule or 'fgsea' conditional collapsing, without changing any p-value.
